    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even when i \"stop moving\" for a bit, the weight just stays there. it feels like there's no actual rest at all. just a temporary pause before i have to start struggling again. i feel like i've done everything i was supposed to do, and i'm still just... empty. it's like there's no point in even trying to fix it anymore.",
